      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Coronary sinus thrombosis was found at necropsy in a girl with spina bifida who underwent ventriculoatrial shunt revision. There was secondary myocardial infarction, close to the conducting system within the interventricular septum. We suggest that this led to cardiac arrest and sudden death."},
